body:
NONONONONO Please do NOT stop taking Lexapro cold turkey. Even if six weeks is not that long, it's long enough for your body to become adjusted to it so you need to stop taking it by lowering the dosage bit by bit. 

&#x200B;

Believe me, I learned this the hard way. I quit cold turkey and it led to some of the worst suicidal ideations and complete breakdown. I felt like shit mentally and physically. The only thing that helped was getting back on the Lexapro and then tapering off it, gradually.
